Version 0.0.7 (in development)

October 04, 2026
 

NOTICE! THIS GAME IS UNDER CONSTRUCTION!
Things you'll notice:

  Bugs
  Documentation is quite incomplete
  No levels yet

DESCRIPTION
-----------
  "ContinueTux" is a game similar to Nintendo's "Super Mario Bros."(tm)
  Run and jump through multiple worlds, fighting off enemies by jumping
  on them or bumping them from below.  Grab power-ups and Linux distributions
  on the way.

  It's meant to be a continuation of SuperTux 0.0.6 that's different from
  SuperTux 0.1.0+.

STORY
-----
  Tux and Gown are having a picnic in Antarctica, when suddenly Gown is
  abducted! Tux must follow the path of clues across the lands to find
  his girlfriend and save her!

DOCUMENTATION
-------------
  Important documentation for "ContinueTux" is contained in multiple files.
  Please see them:

    AUTHORS.txt    - Credits for who made this game.
