    TODO.txt       - A wish-list for this version of ContinueTux.

RUNNING THE GAME
----------------
  Just double click the .exe or .x86_64 to begin.

TITLE SCREEN (FUTURE)
---------------------
  Press [ENTER] to begin a game.

  Press [ESCAPE] or choose [Quit] to quit.

  Use arrow keys to move between menu's items. Press [ENTER] or [SPACE] to validate
  your choice.

  Note: If you're playing ContinueTux in a window, you can also use
  your window manager's close option (usually an "X" button on the window's
  title bar) to quit. This works at ANY time.


